\n\n---\n\n#### 2. DSA Learning Hub & Problem Workspace\n* **Dashboard Overview & Metrics**:\n  * Main header enlarged to **`30px`** with subtitle at **`16px`**.\n  * Large KPI metric numbers (`300`, `0`, `2`, `298`) scaled from `28px` $\\rightarrow$ **`36px`**.\n  * Category and difficulty breakdown headers (`0 / 78`, etc.) increased to **`15.5px`**.\n* **Problem Table & Search**:\n  * Search bar input increased from `14.5px` $\\rightarrow$ **`16px`**.\n  * Problem table rows increased from `13.5px` $\\rightarrow$ **`15px`**; headers to **`13.5px`**.\n  * LeetCode numbers and ID badges (`#1`, `#217`, etc.) enlarged from `12px` $\\rightarrow$ **`14px`**.\n  * Filter pills, topic tags, and difficulty badges enlarged to **`12.5px – 13.5px`**.\n* **Problem Learning Workspace (Panes A, B, C, D)**:\n  * Problem workspace title increased to **`24px`**.\n  * Tab navigation headers increased to **`15px`**.\n  * Problem statement, constraints, and pattern walkthrough prose enlarged to **`15.5px`**.\n  * Workspace Python code editor font size increased from `13px` $\\rightarrow$ **`15.5px`**.\n  * Test case results (inputs, expected values, outputs) enlarged to **`14px`** with code chips at **`13.5px`**.\n  * Reference Python solution code blocks enlarged to **`14.5px`**.\n* **Roadmap & Progression**:\n  * Roadmap phase badges increased to **`13.5px`**; titles to **`18.5px`**.\n  * Phase progress numbers and counters enlarged to **`22px`**.\n  * Quick-jump stage numbers increased to **`12px`** with pill text at **`13.5px`**.\n\n---\n\n### Verification\n* **Phase 10 Master Validation Suite**: **`28 / 28` tests passed (100%)**.\n* **Phase 5 Regression Audit**: **`82 / 82` tests passed (100%)**.\n* **Kadane Execution Output**: Verified at `finalResult = 6`."}
